[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4621.83, "timestamp": "01:17:01", "text": "真的知道为什么。嗯，让我查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4624.31, "timestamp": "01:17:04", "text": "是因为广告拦截器吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4626.63, "timestamp": "01:17:06", "text": "妈的。呃，我的意思是它应该……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4628.79, "timestamp": "01:17:08", "text": "不应该那样做。它应该只是导入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4630.149, "timestamp": "01:17:10", "text": "通常情况下是这样。我真的不太清楚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4632.149, "timestamp": "01:17:12", "text": "为什么不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4634.39, "timestamp": "01:17:14", "text": "自动为您完成。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4636.31, "timestamp": "01:17:16", "text": "有点奇怪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4639.43, "timestamp": "01:17:19", "text": "好吧，我可以，我可以，就像我可以只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4642.87, "timestamp": "01:17:22", "text": "呃，我可以，我可以，呃，帮你重新进口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4644.63, "timestamp": "01:17:24", "text": "如果你想。那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4648.55, "timestamp": "01:17:28", "text": "再次？呃，是哪个Wonder乐队来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4650.31, "timestamp": "01:17:30", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4652.229, "timestamp": "01:17:32", "text": "火花旅行者。不，抱歉。远行者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4653.99, "timestamp": "01:17:33", "text": "是的，远行者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4656.149, "timestamp": "01:17:36", "text": "好的，让我导入一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4659.35, "timestamp": "01:17:39", "text": "为你。嗯，所以它是龙族的，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4663.59, "timestamp": "01:17:43", "text": "乐器，然后呃，就这么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4665.35, "timestamp": "01:17:45", "text": "这。好了，就是这样。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4668.229, "timestamp": "01:17:48", "text": "是的。不知道为什么。呃，好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4670.229, "timestamp": "01:17:50", "text": "我想我还是分享一下屏幕吧，这样你就可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4671.669, "timestamp": "01:17:51", "text": "看看这个，因为这是你想看到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4674.229, "timestamp": "01:17:54", "text": "需要做出选择。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4675.189, "timestamp": "01:17:55", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4677.99, "timestamp": "01:17:57", "text": "让我等一下。错了，错的那个。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4679.99, "timestamp": "01:17:59", "text": "我想我……等等，我分享的是正确的吗？"}]